   Lemanik, Anna; Nadachowski, Adam, Polish Acad Sci, Inst Systemat \& Evolut Anim, Krakow, Poland.
   Banuls-Cardona, Sandra; Lopez-Garcia, Juan Manuel, Univ Rovira \& Virgili, Dept Hist \& Hist Art, Tarragona, Spain.
   Conard, Nicholas J., Univ Tubingen, Dept Early Prehist \& Quaternary Ecol, Tubingen, Germany.
